[0.0519, "o", "ok: [bastion-01.workshop.lan] => {\r\n    \"msg\": \"=== Policy impact analysis ===\\nPermissions the deny rules will remove from blastwall_t:\\n\\n--- alg_socket grants (denied by blastwall-alg-socket-deny.cil) ---\\n\\n\\n--- bpf grants (denied by blastwall-bpf-deny.cil) ---\\n\\n\\n--- capability2/bpf grants (denied by blastwall-bpf-deny.cil) ---\\n\\n\\n--- packet_socket grants (denied by blastwall-packet-socket-deny.cil) ---\\n\\n\\n--- user_namespace grants (denied by blastwall-userns-deny.cil) ---\\n\\n\\n--- netlink_xfrm_socket grants (denied by blastwall-xfrm-deny.cil) ---\\n\\n\\n--- rxrpc_socket grants (denied by blastwall-rxrpc-deny.cil) ---\\n\\n\\n--- security class grants (denied by blastwall-policy-selfprotect.cil) ---\\n\\n\\n--- semanage_exec_t grants (denied by blastwall-policy-selfprotect.cil) ---\\n\\n\\nIf any of these permissions are required by legitimate automation\\ntasks, the corresponding deny scope must be reviewed before\\ndeployment.\\n\"\r\n}\r\n\r\nTASK [Create artifact directory] ***********************************************\r\n"]
[0.410897, "o", "ok: [bastion-01.workshop.lan]\r\n\r\nTASK [Copy RPM to stable artifact path] ****************************************\r\n"]
